  "project_description": "This module allows to create static value mappings for index fields, which will be saved into a new index field. It is possible to map many source values to one target value. The new field is facet compatible.\n\n Example:\n\n source key / value | target value\n\n------------------------------------\n\nopen | undone\n\nwaiting | undone\n\nsuccessfully closed | done\n\nunsuccessfully closed | done\n\n Whether you need the source key or the source value for the mapping depends on the field type. \n\n Tested with Search API, Search API Solr and Facet API.",
